# rpi_kubernetes Code Index

- This repo owns cluster bootstrap, Kubernetes platform services, streaming
  samples, and the local cluster SDK.
- AQP workload manifests live in
  `agentic_quant_platform/deployments/kubernetes`.
- AQP workload controllers live in
  `agentic_quant_platform/aqp_control_plane`.
- Search `docs/code-index.md` before moving code across repo boundaries.
- Keep `rpi_k8s_sdk.AqpControlPlaneClient` as the supported bridge to AQP
  workload control.



AQP path contract: `docs/aqp-monorepo-paths.md`.
